{"type":"message","id":"06cb4bb0","parentId":"6eafb047","timestamp":"2026-04-11T15:24:45.401Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see the issue now! The content IS UTF-8 encoded, but there are Chinese characters mixed in the username (like `'20\\xe8\\xa7\\x86\\xe4\\xbc\\xa0\\xe7\\xbd\\x97\\xe7\\x8e\\xb2'` which is `20视网膜现`). So the content is in UTF-8, but the parsing regex expects ASCII letters for the username.\n\nThe `私聊_11.txt` first file is pure ASCII content and can be decoded as UTF-8. But other files have Chinese characters in the username, which when decoded as UTF-8 gives Chinese text mixed with the number.\n\nSo the format is:\n`2026-03-29 17:35:32 '11' 以上是打招呼的消息`\n\n\n`2023-12-20 21:09:43 '20视网膜现' 我通过了你的朋友验证请求，现在我们可以开始聊天了`\n\nThe username field can contain Chinese characters, and the regex needs to be updated to handle this properly.","thinkingSignature":"e25234b9779b831829b8c18da7320a59cead134bdf3cb14d2b3e9c563822ed67"},{"type":"text","text":"明白了！用户名里可能有中文，需要修复正则：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_lwmh3vaiprij_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"uv run python -c \"\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport re\n\ndata_dir = Path(r'F:\\Wechat shuju\\文案整理\\私聊\\TXT')\nf = list(data_dir.glob('*.txt'))[1]  # second file\ncontent = f.read_text(encoding='utf-8')\nprint('Filename:', f.name)\nprint('First 300 chars repr:', repr(content[:300]))\nprint()\n# Try updated regex: timestamp 'username' message\npattern = r\\\"^(\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2} \\d{2}:\\d{2}:\\d{2}) '([^']+)' (.*)\\\"\nfor line in content.strip().split('\\n')[:5]:\n    m = re.match(pattern, line, re.DOTALL)\n    if m:\n        print('OK:', m.group(1), '|', m.group(2), '|', m.group(3)[:50])\n    else:\n        print('FAIL:', repr(line[:80]))\n\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":22867,"output":451,"cacheRead":32834,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":56152,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"